{"4831830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toey Weedz Smoke Dead Halloween", "steam_appid": 4831830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4849860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! It’s Halloween, and Toey Weedz’s best friend – the famous rapping cow – has been locked up by a motherfucking witch! Save Fatcow in this short and sweet retro FPS single-player campaign, a spooky Halloween special edition set in the Toey Weedz universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/239c0e469d37c0349b63f1aa1672996e.poster.avif?t=1785820574\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/239c0e469d37c0349b63f1aa1672996e.webm?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/239c0e469d37c0349b63f1aa1672996e.mp4?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween Special</strong>: A crazy first-person shooter single-player campaign crafted specifically for Halloween in the Toey Weedz universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rescue Mission</strong>: Save the famous rapping cow from a motherfucking witch and experience pure madness across 9 interconnected, twisted levels of a unique Halloween story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tailored Challenge</strong>: 4 different difficulty levels to suit casual stoners and hardcore gamers alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Skills</strong>: Collect coins, steal items, and buy cool retro skills like the double jump or extra health points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Retro Look</strong>: Impressive Unreal Engine 5 technologies create dynamic lighting that perfectly captures the creepy Halloween atmosphere, completely revitalizing the unique, surreal Toey Weedz retro art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/56aafce4c0446524c58eac7a786a0cf5.poster.avif?t=1785820574\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/56aafce4c0446524c58eac7a786a0cf5.webm?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/56aafce4c0446524c58eac7a786a0cf5.mp4?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pure horror of maximum-chaos stoner trash built on solid shooter gameplay.</strong><br>Dive into a brand-new edition of the well-known and established Toey Weedz video game series. Experience comedy and horror tailored exactly to the taste of series creator and solo developer Tobias Alexander Knobloch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/b30589b2bfaae9e3391ef8e89f877560.poster.avif?t=1785820574\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/b30589b2bfaae9e3391ef8e89f877560.webm?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/b30589b2bfaae9e3391ef8e89f877560.mp4?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! It’s Halloween, and Toey Weedz’s best friend – the famous rapping cow – has been locked up by a motherfucking witch! Save Fatcow in this short and sweet retro FPS single-player campaign, a spooky Halloween special edition set in the Toey Weedz universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/239c0e469d37c0349b63f1aa1672996e.poster.avif?t=1785820574\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/239c0e469d37c0349b63f1aa1672996e.webm?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831830/extras/239c0e469d37c0349b63f1aa1672996e.mp4?t=1785820574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween Special</strong>: A crazy first-person shooter single-player campaign crafted specifically for Halloween in the Toey Weedz universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rescue Mission</strong>: Save the famous rapping cow from a motherfucking witch and experience pure madness across 9 interconnected, twisted levels of a unique Halloween story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tailored Challenge</strong>: 4 different difficulty levels to suit casual stoners and hardcore gamers alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Skills</strong>: Collect coins, steal items, and buy cool retro skills like the double jump or extra health points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Retro Look</strong>: Impressive Unreal Engine 5 technologies create dynamic lighting that perfectly captures the creepy Halloween atmosphere, completely revitalizing the unique, surreal Toey Weedz retro art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i